// The component library as a Linux program (components/spec.md, GitHub
// #13153): the same page openagents.com/components shows
// (components/gallery/page.coax), with the atlas built in Coax
// (components/raster/atlas.coax) and drawn by the shared Wayland and Vulkan
// host (apps/shared/host/linux/). linux/build.sh compiles this file;
// linux/main.c is its host. Its --shot writes a picture with no window,
// which is how the page is looked at on a machine with no WebGPU capture.
#load "page.coax";
#load "../raster/atlas.coax";
